<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01497#man_holding_child> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A man in traditional attire is holding a young child in his arms. The man is standing in a doorway, and the child is dressed in colorful clothing. The scene is framed by a doorway with a fire extinguisher visible on the left side. The text overlays suggest a harmful stereotype about marriage practices."@en .
_:n1ebee3eb46024fa8958a643a8987362ab17 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> _:n1ebee3eb46024fa8958a643a8987362ab18 .
