<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01497#stereotype_muslims_married_to_children> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A deeply offensive and false stereotype that falsely claims that Muslim men are married to children, which is used to dehumanize and demonize Muslims. This is a baseless myth with no factual basis in Islamic teachings or practices, and it is often used in hate speech and propaganda to incite prejudice and fear against Muslims. The meme relies on this stereotype to provoke shock and ridicule."@en .
