<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01497#concept_child_marriage> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The practice of marrying individuals below the legal age of consent, often occurring in some cultures and regions, though it is widely condemned internationally as a violation of human rights. While child marriage exists in some parts of the world, it is not a practice endorsed by Islam, and many Muslim-majority countries have laws against it. The meme misrepresents this concept by associating it with Islam, which is a distortion of reality."@en .
