<http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#motionBlurIntegratedWith> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "motion blur integrated with"@en .
<http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#DirectSuperimposition> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Text or elements directly overlaid on top of other content in memes"@en .
<http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#TemplateStructure> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Underlying structural patterns and organizational frameworks of memes"@en .
