<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01497#assertion_about_01497> <http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general#hasToxicityExplanation> "The meme promotes a false and offensive stereotype that Muslims are married to children, which is a harmful myth with no basis in Islamic teachings. This stereotype degrades the dignity of Muslims and contributes to hate and misinformation."@en .
<http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#Color-matchedIntegration> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#DimensionsAlignment> .
