<http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#compositionallyIntegratedWith> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Indicates compositional design integration between dimension instances"@en .
<http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#Scene> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#Dimension> .
<http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#VisualMaterial> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Visual Material includes: people, objects, characters, scenes, graphics, and any salient visual elements."@en .
<http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#Metadata> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Descriptive information about memes, including technical and contextual metadata"@en .
